"**FB_Reinit** — _lifecycle-method_

Re-initialization method. Called after online-change copy; callable from app code to reset an instance.

Must be implemented explicitly to take effect. No parameters. Return type BOOL (ignored). Use to re-derive values after the copy operation has placed the instance at a new memory location.

\`\`\`iec61131
METHOD FB_Reinit : BOOL
(* no parameters *)
\`\`\`

_Source: [docs/codesys-reference/11-fb-lifecycle.md](https://content.helpme-codesys.com/en/CODESYS%20Development%20System/_cds_method_fb_init_fb_reinit.html)_"
