bFlagA : BIT
\`\`\`

_struct field_

---

**BIT** — _data-type_

1-bit type — only valid inside STRUCT or FB declarations. Successive BIT vars pack into bytes.

**Gotchas**
- NOT in IEC 61131-3 — CODESYS extension.
- POINTER TO BIT, REFERENCE TO BIT, ARRAY OF BIT are all forbidden.
- Bit access is significantly slower than BOOL access.

_Source: [docs/codesys-reference/06-data-types.md](https://content.helpme-codesys.com/en/CODESYS%20Development%20System/_cds_reference_datatypes.html)_"
